              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Belshazari ukafunya momu Danieli urusho mwarwao gha zambarau, na kungirwa mkufu ghwa dhahabu singonyi kwake; sena itangazo jibonyo kukaia uchakaia wa cheo cha kadadu andenyi ya wuzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.29",
